PO : 230111

Page : Load Start

Bill In Time : //input[@name="billsInTime"]
Unload Start Time : //input[@name="lumpStartTime"]
Add Employee : //div[@id="addEmployee"]


Page : Unload End / Check Out

Total Start pallets : //input[@name="totalstartpallets"]

CHEP : //input[@name="startChepPallets"]
PECO : //input[@name="startPECOPallets"]
IGPS ://input[@name="startIGPSPallets"]
WOOD : //input[@name="startBrownPallets"]

End Large Pallets : //input[@name="endLargePallets"]

Unload Finish Time : //input[@name="lumpEndTime"]
Bills Out Time : //input[@name="billsOutTime"]
Bills to Driver Time : //input[@name="outDoorTime"]

Once you enter the values in page and reach Load Receipt page , just navigate to Payment page 

Payment Page navigation icon : //*[@id="truckActionMenu"]/a[4]

In Payment page 

Click on Alert Dropdown 

Alert : //select[@name="alert"]
Alert option (Payment Complete) : //option[@value="Payment Complete"]

Payment Assistance Fee : //input[@name="isPaymentAssist"]

Choose payment Type : //select[@name="paymentType"]
Payment Option (Relay) : //option[@value="RELAY"]
Check Tendered Check Amount : //input[@name="truckBill.checkTenderedAmount"]
Check Tendered Payment method : //option[@value="21363"]
Check Tendered Check Number : //input[@name="truckBill.checkNumber"]

>>> Now navigate to Load Receipt Page

Load Receipt Navigation Icon : //*[@id="truckActionMenu"]/a[8]
Complete Load Button : //input[@id="complete_load"]

>>>>>>>>>> Delay Reason Choosing Pop-up Modal

Choose Delay Reason Xpath : //select[@id="delayReason"]
Option to choose from the list : //option[@value="32711"]
Complete Load Button : //button[@id="btnDelaySave"]


